            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# TurnOver 1.0, build 7

- TurnOver's own windows, such as this update window, are now handed to VoiceOver to read automatically.
- Only one copy of the TurnOver Key helper runs now. Before, two could start, and both answered Command Control T.
- The TurnOver key is now Caps Lock or Control Option to start with, so VoiceOver's VO keys work straight away.
]]></description>
