            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# TurnOver 1.0, build 5

- The TurnOver key is now Caps Lock or Control Option to start with, so VoiceOver's VO keys work straight away. To keep only one: TurnOver menu, Preferences, Keyboard, TurnOver key.
- Check for updates now says what it found, and brings the update window to the front so VoiceOver can read it.
]]></description>
